// F1-M01 "Ashes at First Light": the mission 1 briefing, a complete demo scene (WP12.5).
//
// Generated with
//     cargo run -p sf_cutscene --bin fountain2scene -- \
//         content/briefings/F1-M01.fountain assets/scenes/f1_m01_briefing.ron
// and then directed by hand like a cartoon briefing. Every edit of the generated skeleton is
// marked with a `//` comment saying `hand edit`; the events that carry only `// line N` are
// exactly as the generator wrote them. A test keeps both promises: the spoken lines, their
// speakers and their order still match the Fountain file word for word, and every event that
// differs from the generator's says `hand edit`.
//
// What was added (see also docs/cutscene-format.md, section 10):
//   - layers: three parallax depths (0.6 wall and dawn, 1.0 floor / table / props, 1.2 hanging lantern)
//     built from rectangles and circles, and the map insert drawn as a map;
//   - characters: a placeholder cutout rig per speaker with torso, head, mouth, two upper arms and
//     two forearms and the five poses neutral / point / lean / arms_crossed / radio;
//   - direction: both walk in and leave, the parentheticals became poses, the camera drifts and
//     pushes in on important lines, a cut to the map with pins and an arrow, the radio click.
//   - timing: the dialogue durations are the importer's (words / 2.5 per second); only the pauses
//     between lines grew, three of them on purpose: half a second to read the map, a longer pause
//     before Mira's doubt, a beat before the closing line. Everything else is the importer's 0.3 s.
// There is no explosion in this briefing, so the camera does not shake; nobody speaks over the
// radio (V.O.), so there is no off-screen speaker to show. The figures are geometric placeholders;
// there are no files to be missing and the sound slots are silent (`sound: None`, the writer's wish
// is in `note`).
#![enable(implicit_some)]
Scene(
    format: 1,
    name: "f1_m01_briefing",
    title: "F1-M01 — Ashes at First Light (briefing)",
    source: "content/briefings/F1-M01.fountain",
    stage: (width: 1920, height: 1080),
    layers: [
        // -- the command post, depth 1 of 3 (parallax 0.6): the tent wall and the dawn outside
        (name: "forward_command_post_dawn_canvas", art: Rect(w: 3000.0, h: 1700.0, color: "#a39a74"), pos: (0.0, 0.0), parallax: 0.6, z: -40, shots: ["forward_command_post_dawn"]),  // tent wall: sand canvas
        (name: "forward_command_post_dawn_seam_1", art: Rect(w: 16.0, h: 1700.0, color: "#8e8660"), pos: (-1000.0, 0.0), parallax: 0.6, z: -39, shots: ["forward_command_post_dawn"]),
        (name: "forward_command_post_dawn_seam_2", art: Rect(w: 16.0, h: 1700.0, color: "#8e8660"), pos: (-330.0, 0.0), parallax: 0.6, z: -39, shots: ["forward_command_post_dawn"]),
        (name: "forward_command_post_dawn_seam_3", art: Rect(w: 16.0, h: 1700.0, color: "#8e8660"), pos: (330.0, 0.0), parallax: 0.6, z: -39, shots: ["forward_command_post_dawn"]),
